hoisty (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial package, renamed from slack-deploy.
  * Daemons start locked; the passphrase arrives over a root-only unix socket
    in /run/hoisty instead of a console prompt.
  * Whole install under /var/lib/hoisty, with app/ and venv/ read-only to the
    service account.
  * Vendored virtualenv, every wheel checked against the sha256 recorded in
    requirements.txt.

